// The few-row GEMM: D (M x N) = X (M x K) . W (K x N) for M up to m_max, at DeepSeek-V2-Lite's
// hidden size K. N is one tile of an expert's columns: the column count does not change a pass,
// only how many output blocks a task runs.
{
  K: 2048,
  N: 128,
  m_max: 32,
  seed: 8816,
}
